cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Explain UI: interactive web application and AI-assisted patient builder for the Explain physiological simulation engine"
abstract: >-
  Vue 3 web application that runs the Explain neonatal and fetal physiological
  simulation engine in real time in the browser (diagram, monitors, charts,
  device panels), and hosts the AI-assisted patient-parameterization layer: a
  structured patient-builder form and a bounded language-model interpretation
  layer whose commands are validated against the same schema and bounds as
  manual entry before the deterministic calibrator in the engine fits them.
type: software
